WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
An agent can return the right answer while doing the wrong thing.

00:10.000 --> 00:22.000
ORBITAL Sigma runs a local, reproducible flight-assurance workflow.

00:22.000 --> 00:38.000
The candidate is faster and cheaper in labeled deterministic replay.

00:38.000 --> 00:58.000
The agent declares store credit. Independent evidence observes a synthetic nine-hundred-dollar refund.

00:58.000 --> 01:20.000
Counterfactual analysis attributes the failure and minimizes seventeen elements to seven.

01:20.000 --> 01:38.000
The evidence supports authority through level three.

01:38.000 --> 01:58.000
CLEARANCE issues a restricted Ed25519 certificate using deterministic policy.

01:58.000 --> 02:15.000
SigNoz records the evidence and delivers a signed drift alert.

02:15.000 --> 02:32.000
WATCHTOWER suspends the certificate, sends canary traffic to zero, and restores the baseline.

02:32.000 --> 02:47.000
OPA and GATE block authority laundering through another synthetic agent.

02:47.000 --> 02:55.000
ORBITAL Sigma: trust, but independently verify.
